	image.0187204EE96B9F40.title: "Pipez for simple jobs, LaserIO for compact machine rooms, XNet for large networks, routers for special tasks."
	image.02490E1B7B23E641.title: "With the crystallizer, washer, dissolution and injection chamber you turn every ore into five ingots."
	image.0478C75353362B85.title: "The laser drill mines ores out of nothing. Colored lenses increase the chance for specific ores."
	image.05963A024998D388.title: "The steam quarry with a steel drill yields antimony, bauxite and salt – ores no sieve can give you."
	image.06B3BA14203212C7.title: "Passive reactors produce power directly. Actively cooled reactors produce steam for turbines – much more efficient."
	image.06F1C128A7C0D088.title: "An autoclicker in front of a sieve replaces hours of clicking. Combine it with a hopper underneath."
	image.10F42D01258B1E08.title: "Every mob killed has a 20% chance to drop Inferium Essence – a small mob farm covers the start."
	image.11F0A552FE73909A.title: "You craft all four inscriber presses here by recipe: sky stone, iron blocks and a core material."
	image.1D0266C24776BF31.title: "Monsters need darkness and full blocks. A 2-block-high, unlit hall above your base is ideal."
	image.1E7EB0AF92D10049.title: "Build a small platform with a waystone at your portal in the Nether – that way you always find your way back."
	image.2BAFCE51CBE455B3.title: "Compost saplings, leaves and food scraps in the barrel. In skyblock, dirt is worth its weight in gold."
	image.3062FC93F0C01AFB.title: "If a ritual doesn't glow, a chalk mark is usually missing. The handbook shows every pattern as a preview."
	image.3AD06D3494F82E7E.title: "Press R on gravel, sand or dust to see all sieve and hammer drops including their chances."
	image.3B2C8F30FC942BC4.title: "Shift-right-clicking an MI multiblock controller shows you the structure as a hologram."
	image.3EA3FB447C356440.title: "Wind generators produce more power the higher they are placed – skyblock islands are perfect for that."
	image.422258CC7F093F7B.title: "Flux Networks connects all your generators and machines without a single cable."
	image.45C11F8234F791C7.title: "Place several sieves next to each other: one click sifts all of them at once – up to 3×3!"
	image.4DEED0816FE2724D.title: "Every device needs a channel. Normal cables carry 8, dense cables 32. Smart cables show the usage."
	image.4FB3AD2B309595CE.title: "Oritech machines show addon slots when placed. Speed, efficiency and capacity addons are always worth it."
	image.593B8665581D595A.title: "The alloy forge needs power: place a combustion generator next to it and connect both with conduits."
	image.5BD0403A35A7EA4A.title: "Ritual tablets conjure complete islands with biomes, animals and even villages – priceless in skyblock."
	image.5EB812536D2525EB.title: "Essence farmland increases the yield. Supremium farmland under a crop is almost always worth it."
	image.61C23FD3295F1F29.title: "Open the side tab of Mekanism machines to configure inputs and outputs by color."
	image.68CDC70B4A920BFC.title: "Hold the hammer and look at the 3D preview in the manual. The marked spot is where you click."
	image.700E1B35F9ACBEDD.title: "Ender IO conduits bundle up to nine different conduit types in a single block."
	image.744B6C230E2F1C55.title: "Novaris accepts any metal of the matching type here – osmium from Mekanism works just as well."
	image.7541B89ED80B3B64.title: "Build the energy core early. Fusion crafting and the gear need enormous amounts of energy."
	image.7A7BE27E365F3C07.title: "Chest and furnace upgrades improve existing blocks directly – their contents are kept."
	image.7F5B124FC8541A9B.title: "Bring blocks, a bow and plenty of food. The end crystals on the pillars heal the dragon!"
